NAME
    tar - create, list, and extract bounded uncompressed ustar archives

SYNOPSIS
    tar -cf ARCHIVE PATH...
    tar -tf ARCHIVE
    tar -xf ARCHIVE

DESCRIPTION
    Creates and reads POSIX ustar archives without compression. Creation and
    extraction stream file payloads in bounded chunks; one archive is limited
    to the 1 MiB transactional-file profile. Regular files, directories, and
    safe relative symbolic links are supported.

    Extraction rejects absolute paths, parent traversal, unsafe link targets,
    unsupported record types, corrupt checksums, and writes through symbolic
    link path components. ARCHIVE must be a filesystem path; - is not supported.
